#: properties.py:181
msgid "Name for each exported file (without the extension).\nSupports subdirectories with '/' as a universal separator.\nUse the dropdown to insert tokens:\n$OBJ (Object), $COLL (Immediate Collection), $COLL_PATH (Full Collection Hierarchy), $SCENE (Scene), $BLEND (File Name), $DATE (YYYY-MM-DD), $TIME (HHMMSS).\nIf left blank it falls back to the object / collection / .blend name for the mode."
